{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_453.json","id":243026,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Wheybolic Alpha Cookies and Cream","brandName":"GNC AMP Advanced Muscle Performance","brandIpSymbol":"none","upcSku":"0 48107 21380 0","productVersionCode":"CODE 034570 LUG","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"22","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":317625},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":221123},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":221108},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":260074},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":220215},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":243069},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":221113},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":243061},{"type":"Image difference, same product","labelId":221123}],"contacts":[{"contactId":9079,"text":"Distrubuted by","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_3.json","id":9079,"name":"General Nutrition Corporation","streetAddress":"","city":"Pittsburgh","state":"PA","country":"USA","zipCode":"15222","phoneNumber":"1-888-462-2548","email":"","webAddress":"gnc.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":45.63,"unit":"Ounce(s)","display":"45.63 Ounce(s)"},{"order":2,"quantity":2.85,"unit":"Pound(s)","display":"2.85 Pound(s)"},{"order":3,"quantity":1293.6,"unit":"Gram(s)","display":"1293.6 Gram(s)"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":58.8,"maxQuantity":58.8,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":2,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"2 scoops","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Myotor Muscle Accelerator"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Enhanced with MyoTOR for improved strength & stamina"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Clinically Proven To:\nAccelerate results in as early as 2 weeks\nImprove bench press by 30 lb and leg extension by 22 lb.\nIncrease arm circumference and improve lean body mass"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"An 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 33 healthy men compared the effectiveness of this proprietary module of whey protein and leucine vs. an isocaloric carbohydrate placebo consumed before and after resistance training. Subjects consuming the leucine-whey protein supplement experienced greater increases in muscle strength than those on the placebo. Leucine-whey protein supplementation also increased muscle cross-sectional area from baseline."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"An 8-week randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 118 healthy men participating in a supervised resistance training program showed that those taking MyoTOR had significant increases in mean upper body strength (49.7 lb. vs. 19.4 lb.), mean lower body strength (42.1 lb. vs. 19.2 lb.) and muscle endurance after 8 weeks vs. those who took a placebo with the same exercise. Improvements in strength were seen in as early as 2 weeks. Men on MyoTOR had greater improvements in muscle strength and endurance vs. those who took a placebo but exercised twice as much."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"An 8-week randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 40 healthy men participating in a voluntary exercise routine showed that those taking MyoTOR had significant improvements in upper and lower body strength, muscle endurance, arm circumference and lean body mass vs. those on a placebo after 8 weeks. Improvements in strength were seen in as early as 2 weeks."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BETAPOWER is a registered trademark of DuPont or its affiliates.\nMyoTOR is a trademark of PLT Health Solutions - Laila Nutraceuticals, LLC. US Patent #9,907,825 and international patents pending.\nTestofen is a registered trademark of Gencor.\nVelositol and its associated logo is a trademark of Nutrition 21, LLC. Velositol is patent protected."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Informed-Choice.org \nTrusted by Sport"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by LGC Science, Inc., a world-class anti-doping lab. \nProduct was tested for over 220 banned substances on the 2020 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via LGC skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Con-Cret Reinforced\nTrademarks of Vireo Systems, Inc. Creatine\nHCl is covered by one or more patents: www.vireosystems.com/patents/"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Clinically Proven Protein + Test & Power"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Proven to increase muscle strength in as early as 2 weeks\nEnhanced to support testosterone levels & power"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"40g Protein\n15g EAA\n6.2g Leucine\n650mg MyoTOR\nPer 2 Scoops"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Cookies and Cream \nNatural + artificial flavors"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, consume 2 scoops in 8 fl. oz. of cold water or your favorite beverage. Wheybolic™ Alpha can be consumed first thing in the morning, pre-workout and/or post-workout. For maximum results, reference usage benefits and consume 2 scoops twice daily."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not exceed recommended dose. Consume ample amounts of water while taking this product."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Warning: Cancer and Reproductive Harm – www.P65Warnings.ca.gov."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten free, no soy."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Notice: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Product sold by weight not volume. Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Banned Substance Free"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Superior Performance Protein\nEnhanced with more leucine & BCAA than standard whey protein"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Elevated muscle fuel for muscle growth & recovery"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Featuring clinically studied Betapower + Creatine, MyoTOR & TESTOFEN"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"To Enhance Power, Improve Strength & Stamina and Support Testosterone Level\nOnly Whey Hydrolysates and a Clinical Core of Whey Isolate & Leucine to Improve Strength"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Usage Benefits:\nClinically Proven Support for Strength, Power, Performance & Stamina for Superior Results"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"For Post-Workout & Cardio\nProvides Fast-Digesting Whey Isolate & Hydrolysates Plus Leucine to Fuel Muscle Support & Recovery\nOn Non-Training Days & Between Meals\nProvides High-Quality Protein & Critical Amino Acids to Fuel Muscles while you Recover from Intense Training, Plus Healthy Testosterone Support"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"If it’s on our labels, then it’s in our bottles. Full dosing, full transparency and no proprietary blends. Clinically studied ingredients backed by real science. The most effective and premium performance protein available. Get power. Be alpha."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"EAA= essential amino acids"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2021-04-22","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":"","notes":"","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":58.8,"operator":"=","quantity":210,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"},{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":29.4,"operator":"=","quantity":110,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[],"name":"Calories","category":"other","ingredientGroup":"Calories","uniiCode":"1","alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":2,"ingredientId":4822,"description":"","notes":"","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":58.8,"operator":"=","quantity":1.5,"unit":"Gram(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[{"name":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","operator":"=","percent":2,"footnote":null}],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"},{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":29.4,"operator":"=","quantity":0.5,"u